WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:48.570
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:48.840 --> 01:50.480
Judging from the surveillance footage,

3
01:51.040 --> 01:52.959
this was a premeditated kidnapping.

4
01:53.400 --> 01:54.319
So far,

5
01:55.040 --> 01:56.239
have we received any

6
01:56.239 --> 01:58.680
ransom messages or calls regarding Professor Du?

7
01:59.799 --> 02:00.319
No.

8
02:01.239 --> 02:01.719
None.

9
02:01.799 --> 02:03.480
However, we have already identified

10
02:03.480 --> 02:04.760
the two kidnappers.

11
02:04.840 --> 02:07.719
They are both subordinates of Country M

12
02:07.719 --> 02:10.000
drug lords Piyazi and Xiang Dong.

13
02:10.199 --> 02:12.280
But as for Professor Du's exact whereabouts,

14
02:12.280 --> 02:14.800
we haven't found anything yet.

15
02:14.919 --> 02:17.000
Rest assured, everyone.

16
02:17.000 --> 02:20.400
We will solve this case swiftly.

17
02:21.080 --> 02:22.280
The reason we asked you here

18
02:22.280 --> 02:24.599
is mainly to have you tell us

19
02:24.599 --> 02:26.039
a bit about Professor Du.

20
02:26.120 --> 02:30.240
For example, what his daily habits are,

21
02:31.240 --> 02:33.400
and whether he suffers from any illness.

22
02:33.400 --> 02:36.759
These details could help our investigation.

23
02:36.840 --> 02:38.000
We also know

24
02:38.360 --> 02:42.599
that Piyazi has established

25
02:43.039 --> 02:45.680
a drug distribution network in mainland China.

26
02:46.080 --> 02:48.319
Is it possible Professor Du

27
02:48.360 --> 02:50.560
had contact with Piyazi's people

28
02:50.759 --> 02:56.159
before coming to Country M?

29
02:57.000 --> 02:58.039
You don't seriously think

30
02:58.039 --> 02:59.680
an internationally renowned scientist

31
02:59.680 --> 03:01.719
is tied to drug dealers, do you?

32
03:01.960 --> 03:04.280
When Professor Du was taken hostage,

33
03:04.280 --> 03:08.199
he never called out for help.

34
03:08.199 --> 03:09.719
If someone held two guns to your head,

35
03:09.719 --> 03:11.240
I'm sure you wouldn't scream either.

36
03:11.319 --> 03:12.439
I understand your point.

37
03:12.919 --> 03:16.520
It's just that in our line of work,

38
03:16.520 --> 03:20.080
we have to consider every possibility.

39
03:22.599 --> 03:23.680
Before I came here,

40
03:23.759 --> 03:26.120
I spoke in depth with Prof. Du's family.

41
03:26.520 --> 03:27.719
He would never do

42
03:27.719 --> 03:29.240
what you're suggesting.

43
03:29.919 --> 03:31.120
So right now, our focus

44
03:31.120 --> 03:31.919
should probably be on

45
03:31.919 --> 03:33.319
how to rescue Professor Du.

46
03:34.520 --> 03:35.240
Officer Li,

47
03:35.520 --> 03:36.560
regarding this matter,

48
03:36.719 --> 03:38.280
Country M's police take it very seriously.

49
03:38.599 --> 03:39.439
I'm sorry.

50
03:41.000 --> 03:42.280
Please understand.

51
03:42.280 --> 03:44.000
But as you know,

52
03:44.360 --> 03:46.280
we're under immense pressure too.

53
03:47.360 --> 03:51.360
We also want to crack this case as soon as possible.

54
03:57.360 --> 03:59.439
As it involves international drug cartels,

55
04:00.199 --> 04:01.120
Interpol

56
04:01.280 --> 04:02.680
takes Professor Du's case very seriously.

57
04:05.080 --> 04:08.680
Officer Li, I must remind you,

58
04:09.000 --> 04:10.159
just like us,

59
04:10.879 --> 04:13.520
you lack investigative power in Country M.

60
04:14.800 --> 04:16.000
Strictly speaking,

61
04:16.480 --> 04:18.199
your assistance to Country M's police

62
04:18.399 --> 04:21.279
is limited to sharing files and intel.

63
04:23.399 --> 04:24.879
I understand the international protocol.

64
04:25.120 --> 04:26.839
Besides knowing that Professor Du

65
04:27.240 --> 04:29.120
was kidnapped by Piyazi's crew,

66
04:29.319 --> 04:31.360
what else does Interpol know?

67
04:33.519 --> 04:35.920
Professor Du traveled to Country M alone.

68
04:36.720 --> 04:37.600
The seminar participants

69
04:37.800 --> 04:38.399
know very little about

70
04:38.439 --> 04:40.240
Professor Du's actions around the time

71
04:40.279 --> 04:41.120
of his disappearance.

72
04:42.160 --> 04:43.160
Based on our assessment,

73
04:43.439 --> 04:44.879
Professor Du was very likely

74
04:44.959 --> 04:46.240
abducted by Piyazi

75
04:46.519 --> 04:48.439
to the drug lab in Jiechan State.

76
04:49.480 --> 04:50.160
But without

77
04:50.240 --> 04:51.800
sufficient evidence and leads,

78
04:52.439 --> 04:54.800
Country M's police won't launch a rescue.

79
05:00.360 --> 05:01.399
The Chinese government

80
05:02.560 --> 05:04.639
will never watch its citizens in danger

81
05:05.000 --> 05:06.040
and do nothing.

82
05:06.240 --> 05:09.399
I was ordered to bring Professor Du home safely,

83
05:09.600 --> 05:10.680
and I will fulfill my mission.

84
05:11.199 --> 05:12.920
I'll report to Interpol headquarters

85
05:13.240 --> 05:14.519
to include Professor Du's rescue

86
05:14.920 --> 05:15.839
in the joint international operation

87
05:15.920 --> 05:17.800
against Piyazi's crime syndicate.

88
05:18.480 --> 05:19.920
Once we have Professor Du's whereabouts,

89
05:20.000 --> 05:22.120
I'll urge Country M's police to take action.

90
05:22.279 --> 05:23.040
Thank you.

91
05:28.199 --> 05:30.079
I spoke with Professor Du's family.

92
05:31.279 --> 05:32.600
He's a man of absolute integrity.

93
05:32.680 --> 05:33.279
I believe

94
05:33.519 --> 05:35.879
he'll never yield to Piyazi's force.

95
05:36.560 --> 05:37.800
So we must hurry.

96
05:37.800 --> 05:38.480
Because I'm worried

97
05:38.480 --> 05:40.199
his life could be in danger at any moment.

98
05:41.519 --> 05:42.720
What do you plan to do?

99
05:43.240 --> 05:44.399
How can I

100
05:45.439 --> 05:47.279
get in touch with Piyazi's men?

101
05:49.160 --> 05:51.920
Piyazi has men in both Country M and Xilano.

102
05:52.120 --> 05:53.920
They often hang around

103
05:53.959 --> 05:54.879
entertainment venues.

104
05:55.560 --> 05:56.000
Tell you what,

105
05:56.720 --> 05:58.199
I'll send their files

106
05:58.360 --> 05:59.800
to your email, alright?

107
06:02.360 --> 06:04.639
But I must remind you,

108
06:04.720 --> 06:05.839
under any circumstances,

109
06:05.839 --> 06:07.680
stay within your investigative authority.

110
06:08.079 --> 06:10.360
Never unlawfully carry or use firearms.

111
06:10.720 --> 06:11.199
Understood.

112
06:26.319 --> 06:27.279
What's wrong with you guys?

113
06:30.639 --> 06:31.279
What are you doing?

114
06:45.399 --> 06:46.720
Don't kill me! Don't kill me!

115
06:46.759 --> 06:47.319
Li Qiang!

116
06:49.240 --> 06:49.959
Don't kill him!

117
07:16.160 --> 07:16.639
Get in.

118
07:19.040 --> 07:19.879
Get in.

119
07:47.399 --> 07:48.959
He stopped the car to help us.

120
07:50.959 --> 07:52.079
Why did you hurt him?

121
07:52.399 --> 07:53.519
If he got suspicious,

122
07:53.560 --> 07:54.560
we'd be in deep trouble.

123
07:55.839 --> 07:57.639
Besides, we need money right now.

124
08:01.680 --> 08:03.000
Have you always been like this?

125
08:03.240 --> 08:04.240
For your own sake,

126
08:04.399 --> 08:05.879
with no regard for anyone else's life?

127
08:10.959 --> 08:12.040
What matters most right now

128
08:12.079 --> 08:14.040
is that we stay alive.

129
08:15.959 --> 08:16.560
Don't worry.

130
08:17.600 --> 08:18.680
Once we meet my big brother,

131
08:19.360 --> 08:20.600
everything will be fine.

132
08:27.120 --> 08:28.199
Can you promise me

133
08:28.519 --> 08:30.040
never to kill anyone again?

134
08:33.240 --> 08:34.879
At least don't kill the innocent.

135
08:35.000 --> 08:36.279
You're not even my woman.

136
08:37.720 --> 08:39.440
What right do you have to make demands?

137
08:49.039 --> 08:49.879
I promise you.

138
08:50.960 --> 08:52.399
I know you hate me.

139
08:52.840 --> 08:53.440
In your eyes,

140
08:53.559 --> 08:55.080
I'm just an unforgivable bastard.

141
08:55.399 --> 08:56.320
But I want to tell you,

142
08:56.320 --> 08:57.799
I'm not who you think I am.

143
09:00.480 --> 09:01.159
I hope

144
09:01.159 --> 09:03.120
we can give each other another chance

145
09:03.960 --> 09:05.159
to get to know each other.

146
09:08.960 --> 09:11.600
If in the end you still only hate me,

147
09:11.600 --> 09:12.399
with no love left,

148
09:16.039 --> 09:18.120
at least I won't have any regrets.

149
09:27.000 --> 09:27.639
Li Xiao,

150
09:29.600 --> 09:31.360
can we start over?

151
09:33.120 --> 09:34.080
This time,

152
09:35.679 --> 09:36.600
you're a cop,

153
09:38.799 --> 09:40.360
and I'm a coffee shop owner.

154
09:41.320 --> 09:42.759
I know who you are,

155
09:46.039 --> 09:48.240
but I still want to be with you.

156
11:02.080 --> 11:03.919
Actually, I've been torn, too.

157
11:04.440 --> 11:07.080
Whenever I think about what I told you that day,

158
11:08.519 --> 11:11.399
I really feel like I was being selfish.

159
11:15.759 --> 11:17.360
Can we start over?

160
11:18.320 --> 11:19.159
This time,

161
11:20.320 --> 11:21.240
you're a cop,

162
11:23.360 --> 11:25.080
and I run a coffee shop.

163
11:25.840 --> 11:27.279
I know who you are,

164
11:30.519 --> 11:32.759
but I still want to be with you.

165
11:34.360 --> 11:35.679
I thought since it's the weekend,

166
11:35.799 --> 11:36.919
we could spend some more time together.

167
11:37.279 --> 11:37.960
Turns out...

168
11:39.080 --> 11:40.279
Come on.

169
11:40.399 --> 11:42.480
Do you think I'm that petty?

170
11:44.240 --> 11:45.559
It's fine, go on.

171
11:45.960 --> 11:46.799
Go on, go.

172
11:50.080 --> 11:51.000
I'll head inside, then.

173
11:51.080 --> 11:51.559
Go ahead.

174
12:27.960 --> 12:28.639
Last year,

175
12:30.639 --> 12:32.279
when I came to Jiangyang,

176
12:33.360 --> 12:35.240
I had a crew of brothers with me.

177
12:40.200 --> 12:41.279
Now coming back,

178
12:41.879 --> 12:42.519
sitting here,

179
12:44.559 --> 12:46.159
I'm the only one left.

180
12:48.279 --> 12:49.840
My closest brothers...

181
12:51.679 --> 12:53.960
one has vanished without a trace,

182
12:54.799 --> 12:55.600
and the other

183
12:56.919 --> 12:58.320
died right here in Jiangyang.

184
13:06.240 --> 13:07.399
You mean

185
13:08.759 --> 13:10.159
Li Qiang and Xiao Yunfei?

186
13:13.159 --> 13:14.279
They were just like you.

187
13:16.559 --> 13:18.799
We went through life and death together.

188
13:19.799 --> 13:20.639
Right now,

189
13:21.559 --> 13:23.600
my only wish is for Li Qiang to be

190
13:24.559 --> 13:25.399
safe

191
13:26.720 --> 13:27.360
and sound.

192
13:31.720 --> 13:34.799
You really value loyalty, don't you?

193
13:37.639 --> 13:39.679
I've hurt a lot of people.

194
13:40.320 --> 13:41.159
Some of them

195
13:41.879 --> 13:43.200
had no grudge against me.

196
13:43.399 --> 13:46.000
I didn't even know

197
13:46.000 --> 13:46.759
their names.

198
13:47.360 --> 13:51.440
But brothers who faced life and death with me are different.

199
13:54.320 --> 13:56.279
Brothers are family.

200
13:59.799 --> 14:01.159
Family never betrays.

201
14:07.879 --> 14:08.639
To family.

202
14:29.120 --> 14:29.759
You're back.

203
14:37.519 --> 14:39.200
You talked with Ma Jingrong for so long today.

204
14:39.320 --> 14:40.440
Did you find out anything?

205
14:41.600 --> 14:42.559
He wants me tomorrow

206
14:42.600 --> 14:44.240
to go with him to meet his old downlines.

207
14:44.559 --> 14:47.159
We'll use them to find his old major clients.

208
14:48.200 --> 14:49.200
Once that's done,

209
14:49.279 --> 14:51.840
we can report back to Theerade.

210
14:55.480 --> 14:56.320
What are you doing?

211
14:57.080 --> 14:57.919
Don't move.

212
15:00.480 --> 15:01.200
Does it look good?

213
15:02.720 --> 15:03.279
It looks good.

214
15:06.879 --> 15:07.480
Wait,

215
15:09.039 --> 15:09.799
Comrade Ge Dan,

216
15:10.039 --> 15:11.320
we're here on a mission,

217
15:11.639 --> 15:12.600
not on vacation.

218
15:14.200 --> 15:15.600
Can't you be a little sweeter?

219
15:16.360 --> 15:17.679
Do you know what today is?

220
15:18.960 --> 15:19.639
Your birthday.

221
15:22.120 --> 15:22.799
You remembered?

222
15:24.039 --> 15:25.159
When women ask that,

223
15:25.440 --> 15:26.960
it's either a birthday or an anniversary.

224
15:27.000 --> 15:28.000
If I didn't know that,

225
15:28.000 --> 15:28.960
how could I play your husband?

226
15:31.799 --> 15:32.799
You're no fun.

227
15:43.679 --> 15:44.320
Wait for me a second.

228
15:45.840 --> 15:46.840
Don't come over unless I call you!

229
16:09.720 --> 16:10.720
I saw it!

230
16:11.600 --> 16:12.799
I saw everything.

231
16:13.200 --> 16:14.519
Move your hand, let me see.

232
16:14.840 --> 16:16.399
I haven't even called you over yet.

233
16:20.799 --> 16:21.840
Even the year I was born,

234
16:21.919 --> 16:23.120
you remember so clearly.

235
16:23.840 --> 16:24.840
You're so sweet.

236
16:25.600 --> 16:26.480
Just the birthday?

237
16:26.600 --> 16:27.399
Look again.

238
16:31.039 --> 16:32.639
This is...

239
16:36.240 --> 16:37.480
You don't even remember this?

240
16:38.559 --> 16:39.120
This is the day

241
16:39.159 --> 16:40.720
we first met at the police academy.

242
16:40.919 --> 16:42.240
How did you even become a cop?

243
16:46.480 --> 16:47.120
Give it to me.

244
16:54.440 --> 16:55.519
A birthday present.

245
16:57.279 --> 16:58.039
For me?

246
17:04.279 --> 17:05.160
Happy birthday.

247
17:07.200 --> 17:07.759
Thank you.

248
17:10.039 --> 17:10.920
This necklace

249
17:12.359 --> 17:13.519
symbolizes protection.

250
17:14.880 --> 17:16.720
No matter what happens in the future,

251
17:18.640 --> 17:19.880
I want you to be safe

252
17:20.960 --> 17:21.720
and sound.

253
17:35.119 --> 17:35.799
Come in.

254
17:36.240 --> 17:36.759
Chief.

255
17:37.279 --> 17:39.359
The people from the Provincial Department and Nanhai Bureau are here.

256
17:40.440 --> 17:41.599
Please show them to the conference room.

257
17:41.720 --> 17:42.160
Yes, sir.

258
17:51.720 --> 17:52.599
Starting now,

259
17:52.680 --> 17:54.799
you must fully cooperate with the Nanhai police

260
17:55.000 --> 17:56.359
on this special operation.

261
18:00.480 --> 18:01.640
Follow me to the conference room.

262
18:07.079 --> 18:09.079
Over the past year, Cheng Weimin

263
18:09.200 --> 18:09.839
has become

264
18:09.920 --> 18:12.039
the biggest drug trafficker in Jiangyang.

265
18:13.200 --> 18:14.519
After Zhongtian Logistics and Xinghai International

266
18:14.519 --> 18:15.640
came under investigation,

267
18:15.960 --> 18:17.400
Cheng Weimin went missing.

268
18:17.759 --> 18:19.200
However, according to our investigation,

269
18:20.000 --> 18:21.119
not only did Cheng Weimin not flee

270
18:21.119 --> 18:22.480
as we had expected,

271
18:22.480 --> 18:23.799
he remains lying low in our city,

272
18:23.960 --> 18:24.880
continuing his drug trafficking activities.

273
18:25.680 --> 18:26.640
The night before last,

274
18:27.680 --> 18:29.359
we moved to arrest Yang Xing,

275
18:29.799 --> 18:30.759
but unexpectedly ran into

276
18:30.799 --> 18:32.000
Piyazi's younger brother, Xiang Nan.

277
18:33.240 --> 18:34.839
Just as we were tracking down Xiang Nan

278
18:34.920 --> 18:36.079
and his accomplices,

279
18:36.319 --> 18:37.519
I received a call from Chief Yan.

280
18:39.599 --> 18:41.519
I received a call from Chief Zhou Xianyang

281
18:41.519 --> 18:43.279
of the Guangnan Provincial Department,

282
18:43.279 --> 18:44.559
so I had Chief Yan

283
18:44.559 --> 18:46.319
issue an emergency order to you.

284
18:49.599 --> 18:50.119
Captain Bai,

285
18:50.440 --> 18:53.000
please brief everyone on the latest progress

286
18:53.119 --> 18:54.000
of Operation Thunderbolt.

287
18:54.440 --> 18:54.880
Yes, sir.

288
18:58.720 --> 18:59.720
Operation Thunderbolt

289
18:59.920 --> 19:01.119
is conducted by our Nanhai police

290
19:01.279 --> 19:02.640
under the deployment of the Provincial Department,

291
19:02.920 --> 19:05.559
alongside Interpol and Country M's police,

292
19:05.559 --> 19:07.720
targeting Piyazi and Theerade,

293
19:07.880 --> 19:09.400
the two major international drug syndicates,

294
19:09.559 --> 19:12.000
in a joint anti-drug campaign.

295
19:12.519 --> 19:14.559
Currently, we have largely mapped out

296
19:14.599 --> 19:15.720
their organizational structure,

297
19:15.960 --> 19:18.680
and two officers have successfully infiltrated them.

298
19:20.279 --> 19:21.400
The night of your raid,

299
19:21.480 --> 19:22.519
our undercover officer

300
19:22.640 --> 19:23.759
was making contact with Xiang Nan.

301
19:24.079 --> 19:26.400
To keep Operation Thunderbolt on track,

302
19:26.440 --> 19:28.400
I urgently consulted Chief Zhou Xianyang

303
19:29.200 --> 19:30.440
to suspend your operation.

304
19:30.519 --> 19:32.119
I deeply apologize for that.

305
19:32.799 --> 19:33.480
Of course,

306
19:33.839 --> 19:35.640
we also hope to have your bureau's full support

307
19:35.799 --> 19:37.119
in our future operations.

308
19:39.279 --> 19:40.680
All right, Captain Bai, please take a seat.

309
19:45.079 --> 19:45.599
Captain Bai,

310
19:46.160 --> 19:48.519
how exactly do you need us to assist you?

311
19:49.599 --> 19:51.960
Our superiors sent Comrade Bai Hua here

312
19:52.640 --> 19:56.079
to ensure that all units and departments

313
19:56.319 --> 19:58.599
can coordinate more effectively

314
19:58.799 --> 20:00.839
for the success of Operation Thunderbolt.

315
20:02.440 --> 20:04.079
Our two undercover officers,

316
20:04.160 --> 20:05.519
are they both in contact now?

317
20:07.119 --> 20:08.519
Not the one beside Xiang Nan yet.

318
20:08.599 --> 20:09.680
However, the other one

319
20:09.960 --> 20:12.240
has already arrived in Jiangyang with Ma Jingrong.

320
20:13.720 --> 20:15.440
Ma Jingrong's purpose on this trip

321
20:15.640 --> 20:17.920
is to find bigger buyers for Theerade.

322
20:18.160 --> 20:19.000
I believe

323
20:19.039 --> 20:20.720
once it's safe for them to act,

324
20:20.759 --> 20:22.079
they'll contact me right away.

325
20:26.079 --> 20:27.839
Communication is crucial.

326
20:28.480 --> 20:31.440
It's also the key to ensuring the success of our operation.

327
20:31.799 --> 20:34.039
As chief liaison officer, Captain Bai,

328
20:34.079 --> 20:36.400
you must keep our lines of communication open.

329
20:36.519 --> 20:37.599
In field operations,

330
20:38.039 --> 20:39.400
our undercover officers

331
20:39.400 --> 20:40.480
may occasionally lose contact

332
20:40.480 --> 20:42.359
due to unforeseen circumstances.

333
20:42.799 --> 20:44.160
If that happens,

334
20:44.319 --> 20:46.599
Captain Bai, you must notify us promptly

335
20:46.920 --> 20:48.920
so we can address emergencies

336
20:49.000 --> 20:50.279
and take immediate action.

337
20:50.839 --> 20:51.319
Understood.

338
20:51.799 --> 20:53.119
Chief Yan is absolutely right.

339
20:53.480 --> 20:54.720
The Jiangyang Anti-Drug Brigade's

340
20:54.720 --> 20:56.440
primary mission right now

341
20:56.759 --> 20:59.240
is to assist the two undercover officers

342
20:59.599 --> 21:01.319
in penetrating deeper into

343
21:01.559 --> 21:02.880
the cartel's inner circle.

344
21:03.400 --> 21:05.559
Meanwhile, based on the intel they provide,

345
21:05.960 --> 21:07.200
we must crack down hard on

346
21:07.440 --> 21:09.640
drug crimes hidden in Jiangyang.

347
21:10.079 --> 21:11.000
Starting now,

348
21:11.279 --> 21:13.599
you will fully cooperate with the Nanhai police,

349
21:13.759 --> 21:16.759
to take on international drug cartels

350
21:16.839 --> 21:17.960
as your special mission.

351
21:19.559 --> 21:20.720
Rest assured, commanders.

352
21:20.720 --> 21:22.039
We will accomplish the mission!

353
21:39.160 --> 21:39.799
Good stuff.

354
21:40.839 --> 21:42.519
Boss Ma, long time no see.

355
21:42.559 --> 21:44.279
Your quality has definitely leveled up.

356
21:46.319 --> 21:47.400
For stuff like this,

357
21:47.960 --> 21:49.519
I'll take whatever you have, Boss Ma.

358
21:51.039 --> 21:52.000
For this pack,

359
21:52.480 --> 21:54.599
I can give it to you at our old price.

360
21:55.319 --> 21:56.440
The rest is open for discussion.

361
21:57.759 --> 21:59.240
My trip to Jiangyang this time...

362
21:59.400 --> 22:00.720
is mainly because...

363
22:01.240 --> 22:02.000
I want to find a few...

364
22:02.119 --> 22:04.359
big clients for long-term cooperation.

365
22:06.119 --> 22:08.200
So it seems small buyers like us...

366
22:08.200 --> 22:09.039
won't have a chance...

367
22:09.039 --> 22:11.759
to make a fortune with Boss Ma anymore?

368
22:13.400 --> 22:14.359
Don't say that.

369
22:15.000 --> 22:18.039
If you can help me find the right clients,

370
22:18.279 --> 22:21.279
consider this pack a gift between friends.

371
22:23.279 --> 22:25.440
Looks like Boss Ma is really aiming big.

372
22:26.599 --> 22:28.599
Boss Ma, you have no idea.

373
22:29.359 --> 22:30.680
These past few months,

374
22:31.079 --> 22:33.079
Jiangyang police's anti-drug operations...

375
22:33.599 --> 22:35.240
haven't stopped for a second.

376
22:36.359 --> 22:37.799
A lot of my old friends...

377
22:38.160 --> 22:40.079
have been busted by the cops.

378
22:42.319 --> 22:44.000
With the heat this intense right now,

379
22:44.279 --> 22:47.039
who'd dare take in such massive shipments?

380
22:50.039 --> 22:50.640
I know.

381
22:51.119 --> 22:52.119
In our line of work,

382
22:52.160 --> 22:53.119
one slip-up...

383
22:53.880 --> 22:55.559
and we all know the consequences.

384
22:57.519 --> 22:58.440
That's why...

385
22:58.440 --> 23:01.319
instead of sneaking around doing petty deals,

386
23:01.359 --> 23:04.799
we might as well pull off a few big ones.

387
23:06.680 --> 23:07.640
Are you interested?

388
23:07.920 --> 23:09.119
Bring your crew,

389
23:09.480 --> 23:11.319
and let's do some big deals together.

390
23:12.880 --> 23:16.200
Since Boss Ma thinks so highly of me,

391
23:16.240 --> 23:17.880
I'd be honored to oblige.

392
23:20.559 --> 23:21.839
But right now,

393
23:22.599 --> 23:23.680
in Jiangyang,

394
23:23.720 --> 23:26.519
anyone with the clout to work with Boss Ma...

395
23:27.839 --> 23:29.759
there really aren't many.

396
23:33.519 --> 23:34.160
How about this?

397
23:34.160 --> 23:35.359
Let me introduce someone to you.

398
23:36.319 --> 23:37.960
Have you ever heard of...

399
23:39.799 --> 23:41.640
a guy named Cheng Weimin?

400
23:44.119 --> 23:45.039
Cheng Weimin?

401
23:45.960 --> 23:48.799
Two years ago, his men bought from me.

402
23:49.279 --> 23:51.599
But he didn't deal in such large volumes.

403
23:52.400 --> 23:53.400
You said it yourself.

404
23:53.759 --> 23:55.119
That was two years ago.

405
23:55.319 --> 23:57.880
Now, this guy plays in the big leagues.

406
24:01.319 --> 24:01.839
I know that.

407
24:01.839 --> 24:04.559
He's partnered with several bosses in the mainland.

408
24:07.319 --> 24:08.440
In a few months, we move...

409
24:08.759 --> 24:12.000
barely a dozen or so kilos.

410
24:12.400 --> 24:13.759
But on his end,

411
24:14.960 --> 24:16.960
they count it in tons.

412
24:18.720 --> 24:20.759
Do you know where he gets his supply?

413
24:22.119 --> 24:23.480
That, I wouldn't know.

414
24:24.519 --> 24:25.839
I just get the feeling...

415
24:25.880 --> 24:27.599
he's never run out of goods.

416
24:28.400 --> 24:29.880
But a while ago,

417
24:30.759 --> 24:33.000
his supplier seemed to run into trouble.

418
24:34.359 --> 24:36.039
Last week, when I went to get goods from him,

419
24:36.559 --> 24:38.759
he told me I had to wait a while.

420
24:42.279 --> 24:44.400
He has the clients, and I have the supply.

421
24:45.599 --> 24:47.000
This deal can work.

422
24:47.359 --> 24:49.000
Since Boss Ma is so interested,

423
24:49.440 --> 24:51.000
I'll do you a favor...

424
24:51.200 --> 24:53.759
and introduce the two of you.

425
24:54.119 --> 24:55.559
Sounds good. Set up a meeting.

426
24:55.599 --> 24:56.079
Alright.

427
25:08.480 --> 25:09.079
Brother Nan,

428
25:09.680 --> 25:12.160
Cheng Weimin hasn't been in touch lately.

429
25:13.720 --> 25:15.720
Why don't we head back to Country M first?

430
25:15.720 --> 25:17.079
Once we're back, we'll be safe.

431
25:17.680 --> 25:19.799
Cheng Weimin got three of my brothers killed.

432
25:20.519 --> 25:22.119
There's no way in hell I'm letting him off.

433
25:25.960 --> 25:27.720
Let me tell you one more time.

434
25:28.240 --> 25:30.480
He has plenty of my client information.

435
25:30.720 --> 25:31.759
If I don't deal with him,

436
25:31.759 --> 25:33.599
how am I supposed to face the boss?

437
25:34.559 --> 25:36.240
I heard Cheng Weimin recently

438
25:36.240 --> 25:37.599
recruited quite a few men.

439
25:37.920 --> 25:38.599
And there are only...

440
25:39.640 --> 25:40.519
three of us.

441
25:41.880 --> 25:42.559
Scared?

442
25:44.400 --> 25:46.359
People call you Four-Legged Snake.

443
25:47.079 --> 25:49.480
Don't tell me you're really like one,

444
25:49.480 --> 25:52.039
dropping your tail and running when trouble hits?

445
25:52.359 --> 25:53.079
Brother Nan,

446
25:53.720 --> 25:55.480
am I really that kind of person?

447
26:03.119 --> 26:06.880
Fine. Whatever you order, we'll do.

448
26:09.720 --> 26:11.200
Keep an eye on Yang Xing.

449
26:13.279 --> 26:14.519
Akai, come with me.

450
26:30.839 --> 26:31.519
Brother Nan.

451
26:34.240 --> 26:35.400
Long time no see.

452
26:35.799 --> 26:36.799
Long time no see.

453
26:37.039 --> 26:37.599
How are things?

454
26:37.720 --> 26:38.960
Where's the stuff I asked for?

455
26:39.559 --> 26:40.519
It's been ready for a while.

456
27:12.559 --> 27:13.359
That's a lot.

457
27:15.880 --> 27:16.599
Brother Nan,

458
27:17.680 --> 27:18.640
what's this supposed to mean?

459
27:19.599 --> 27:20.880
This extra 500,000...

460
27:21.200 --> 27:22.640
...is for a favor.

461
27:25.720 --> 27:27.119
I'm not quite following.

462
27:33.000 --> 27:33.799
You see,

463
27:34.200 --> 27:35.960
a few friends are arriving in a couple of days.

464
27:36.559 --> 27:39.359
I need you and the boys to lend a hand.

465
27:41.359 --> 27:42.680
You want me to kill someone.

466
27:43.200 --> 27:44.000
500,000.

467
27:44.799 --> 27:46.240
The 500,000 is just a deposit.

468
27:46.519 --> 27:48.839
When have I ever shortchanged you?

469
27:49.359 --> 27:49.920
What do you say?

470
27:52.440 --> 27:54.359
Fine. Call me before you make a move.

471
27:54.880 --> 27:55.359
That's what I like to hear.

472
27:55.480 --> 27:56.000
I'm out.

473
29:10.880 --> 29:12.440
That's 2.75 million in total.

474
29:12.880 --> 29:13.559
Even if we add

475
29:13.559 --> 29:15.440
what the other bosses owe us,

476
29:16.039 --> 29:17.000
our revenue this month

477
29:17.200 --> 29:19.000
is still far less than previous months.

478
29:29.599 --> 29:30.759
Our Heroin No. 13

479
29:30.839 --> 29:32.240
has been out of stock for two months.

480
29:32.680 --> 29:33.880
And by next month,

481
29:34.279 --> 29:36.319
Psychedelic Blues will basically be gone too.

482
29:37.440 --> 29:38.279
If by that time

483
29:38.279 --> 29:39.640
we still haven't found a supplier,

484
29:41.119 --> 29:42.519
our major clients

485
29:43.079 --> 29:45.400
might turn to other sellers.

486
29:47.000 --> 29:47.599
What?

487
29:48.680 --> 29:50.279
Haven't we made enough money?

488
29:51.200 --> 29:52.200
How much longer do you want to do this?

489
29:52.759 --> 29:54.559
All this money we've made

490
29:54.960 --> 29:56.160
is only enough to buy

491
29:56.160 --> 29:57.440
a single condo in Las Vegas.

492
29:58.559 --> 30:00.279
We've worked so hard for so long

493
30:00.559 --> 30:02.000
and built up so many clients.

494
30:02.440 --> 30:03.759
Why not make a little more?

495
30:09.079 --> 30:11.519
The cops are looking everywhere for me,

496
30:14.119 --> 30:16.559
and Piyazi won't let me off either.

497
30:17.960 --> 30:19.920
You don't care about your husband at all.

498
30:20.359 --> 30:21.880
All you see is money.

499
30:23.160 --> 30:24.720
What did I do wrong in my past life

500
30:24.839 --> 30:26.359
to end up with a woman like you?

501
30:33.680 --> 30:35.599
Behind every successful man,

502
30:35.599 --> 30:37.319
there must be a successful woman.

503
30:38.559 --> 30:39.920
One day,

504
30:40.200 --> 30:42.079
when you reach the pinnacle of your life,

505
30:43.079 --> 30:44.559
you'll definitely thank me for today.

506
30:45.160 --> 30:46.039
All right, enough.

507
30:47.119 --> 30:49.039
Stop going to those success seminars.

508
30:50.519 --> 30:51.799
What pinnacle of life?

509
30:52.920 --> 30:54.759
What business do you think we're in?

510
30:55.759 --> 30:57.440
Does the business even matter?

511
30:57.960 --> 30:59.759
The main thing is making money,

512
31:00.279 --> 31:00.920
isn't it?

513
31:02.559 --> 31:03.759
Honestly, woman,

514
31:04.759 --> 31:06.319
I really don't know what to say to you.

515
31:11.559 --> 31:12.079
Come in.

516
31:14.880 --> 31:15.359
Brother Min.

517
31:16.240 --> 31:17.759
Well? What did you find out?

518
31:17.880 --> 31:18.720
Three days ago,

519
31:18.880 --> 31:20.160
men claiming to be cops

520
31:20.240 --> 31:21.319
took Yang Xing from the club.

521
31:21.839 --> 31:23.119
But the strange thing is,

522
31:23.400 --> 31:24.559
as soon as they left the club,

523
31:24.559 --> 31:25.680
the police ambushed them.

524
31:25.960 --> 31:27.480
I heard there was even a firefight.

525
31:28.839 --> 31:30.400
Cops ambushing cops?

526
31:31.839 --> 31:32.640
You may go.

527
31:32.799 --> 31:33.400
Yes, sir.

528
31:38.359 --> 31:39.119
It's obvious.

529
31:40.039 --> 31:41.720
They weren't real cops.

530
31:55.160 --> 31:56.839
If I'm not mistaken,

531
31:57.680 --> 32:00.319
these guys aren't after Yang Xing.

532
32:01.640 --> 32:03.200
They're after me, Cheng Weimin.

533
32:05.000 --> 32:05.960
What are you talking about?

534
32:06.799 --> 32:08.079
I knew it.

535
32:09.559 --> 32:13.200
This mad dog won't let me go.

536
32:19.680 --> 32:20.519
Brother, want a paper?

537
32:20.640 --> 32:21.119
No.

538
32:21.519 --> 32:22.799
Brother, please, help me out.

539
32:22.880 --> 32:24.079
Times are tough. Buy one, please.

540
32:29.920 --> 32:30.480
Keep the change.

541
32:31.200 --> 32:33.000
Brother! Brother! The paper! The paper!

542
32:36.920 --> 32:37.480
Brother Nan.

543
32:55.160 --> 32:55.680
Boss, boss!

544
32:57.240 --> 32:57.599
Boss!

545
32:57.839 --> 32:58.400
Don't move!

546
33:03.039 --> 33:04.400
Boss, we can talk this out!

547
33:12.880 --> 33:14.519
A grown man selling newspapers, huh?

548
33:37.279 --> 33:38.160
Drive, let's go.

549
34:09.559 --> 34:11.000
It's not that I don't trust you.

550
34:12.880 --> 34:14.599
It's just that after being in this business so long,

551
34:15.559 --> 34:17.360
some habits die hard.

552
34:18.599 --> 34:19.199
I know.

553
34:23.719 --> 34:25.400
Have you ever been to Country M?

554
34:26.519 --> 34:27.400
In all my life,

555
34:27.599 --> 34:28.599
I've never even been abroad.

556
34:28.840 --> 34:30.519
You said you were in the special forces.

557
34:30.719 --> 34:32.320
Never fought in combat on the border?

558
34:33.519 --> 34:34.559
It was peacetime.

559
34:34.679 --> 34:36.079
Not every special forces soldier

560
34:36.280 --> 34:38.199
gets the chance to see real combat.

561
34:38.199 --> 34:40.320
Years in the military and never killed anyone...

562
34:40.920 --> 34:42.280
Don't you feel you missed out?

563
34:42.960 --> 34:43.639
Not really.

564
34:44.360 --> 34:45.239
I only enlisted

565
34:45.480 --> 34:47.280
so I could get a good job later on.

566
34:47.440 --> 34:49.519
Who knew I'd get into drunken brawls in the army,

567
34:49.679 --> 34:50.639
get slapped with a major demerit,

568
34:51.079 --> 34:52.440
and get discharged early.

569
34:52.920 --> 34:54.679
Sounds like you're practically a deserter.

570
34:56.360 --> 34:57.159
Doesn't matter.

571
34:57.400 --> 34:58.880
Stick with me and work hard from now on.

572
34:59.199 --> 35:00.840
You'll definitely make it big.

573
35:00.880 --> 35:02.280
Since you think so highly of me, Brother Nan,

574
35:02.880 --> 35:04.159
I'll give it everything I've got.

575
35:04.440 --> 35:05.639
Do you have the guts to kill someone?

576
35:13.280 --> 35:14.360
Cheng Weimin.

577
35:16.760 --> 35:19.199
Cheng Weimin knows too much about our business.

578
35:20.599 --> 35:21.800
If we don't take him out,

579
35:22.599 --> 35:25.199
all our transit lines will soon be exposed.

580
35:27.599 --> 35:29.159
I heard from Brother Four

581
35:29.400 --> 35:30.400
that Cheng Weimin only went on the run

582
35:30.480 --> 35:32.559
because the cops seized the goods

583
35:32.639 --> 35:33.480
from Zhongtian Logistics.

584
35:33.800 --> 35:35.559
If we kill him just over that,

585
35:35.920 --> 35:37.440
won't the other boys have second thoughts?

586
35:37.719 --> 35:39.000
In our line of work,

587
35:39.360 --> 35:41.360
there's no room for any mistakes.

588
35:41.519 --> 35:43.480
We can't keep one man alive

589
35:43.519 --> 35:44.920
and drag down the rest of our brothers.

590
35:45.519 --> 35:46.360
Besides,

591
35:47.280 --> 35:48.639
even if we don't do it,

592
35:48.840 --> 35:51.079
he won't fare well if the cops catch him.

593
35:51.920 --> 35:53.880
Kid, remember this:

594
35:54.039 --> 35:56.440
whatever you do in our line of work,

595
35:57.159 --> 35:59.320
you have to leave no loose ends.

596
36:01.159 --> 36:03.440
But the cops have already tracked down Yang Xing.

597
36:04.119 --> 36:05.840
Could they follow that lead

598
36:06.039 --> 36:07.119
and find Cheng Weimin?

599
36:08.440 --> 36:09.239
Not likely.

600
36:11.199 --> 36:12.360
I dug into him for so long

601
36:12.599 --> 36:13.880
before I finally got a lead.

602
36:14.159 --> 36:16.559
Those cops aren't that smart.

603
36:18.320 --> 36:19.599
Still, you've got a point.

604
36:20.000 --> 36:21.639
We need to make our move quickly.

605
36:25.920 --> 36:27.519
You haven't answered me yet.

606
36:27.519 --> 36:28.960
Do you have the guts to kill?

607
36:35.280 --> 36:36.559
I don't like killing.

608
36:37.079 --> 36:39.400
But if you insist on it, Brother Nan,

609
36:39.960 --> 36:41.039
all I can say is

610
36:41.880 --> 36:44.000
Cheng Weimin won't be my first kill.

611
36:44.719 --> 36:46.039
So you've done it before.

612
36:47.960 --> 36:49.320
Back when I was in Nanhai,

613
36:49.679 --> 36:51.119
the boss I worked for was Liang Wenbiao.

614
36:51.320 --> 36:53.280
There was an undercover cop working under him,

615
36:54.000 --> 36:54.880
and I took him out.

616
36:58.639 --> 37:00.599
You even had the guts to kill a cop?

617
37:01.880 --> 37:03.159
My hand was forced.

618
37:03.719 --> 37:05.880
Killing someone is never an easy thing.

619
37:07.800 --> 37:08.519
Good.

620
37:09.800 --> 37:11.000
Take out Cheng Weimin,

621
37:11.559 --> 37:13.400
and when we get back, I'll have the big boss reward you well.

622
37:14.320 --> 37:15.039
Thanks, Brother Nan.

623
37:15.280 --> 37:17.159
I'm truly backed into a corner right now.

624
37:18.400 --> 37:19.880
I'll stick with you and do whatever it takes.

625
37:39.639 --> 37:40.679
Going by what you're saying,

626
37:40.800 --> 37:41.960
shouldn't we find a chance

627
37:41.960 --> 37:43.320
to clear things up with Xiang Nan?

628
37:45.559 --> 37:47.639
We've sold almost all his stash.

629
37:48.320 --> 37:49.480
Clear what up?

630
37:50.320 --> 37:51.079
Are you really willing

631
37:51.159 --> 37:53.039
to hand over all the money from these past months?

632
37:54.760 --> 37:57.159
Even if we handed the cash over to him,

633
37:57.559 --> 37:59.480
he still wouldn't let us off the hook.

634
38:00.559 --> 38:01.679
Zhongtian Logistics—

635
38:01.960 --> 38:04.840
such a vital route went down on my watch.

636
38:06.519 --> 38:08.559
Piyazi won't just let this go.

637
38:09.320 --> 38:11.800
What happened to Zhongtian Logistics wasn't your fault.

638
38:11.960 --> 38:13.519
Why should they hold you accountable?

639
38:17.320 --> 38:18.599
You don't know them.

640
38:18.960 --> 38:20.119
When it comes to profit,

641
38:20.639 --> 38:22.039
they're capable of anything.

642
38:23.760 --> 38:25.400
Things have already come to this.

643
38:25.559 --> 38:26.719
Overthinking it won't help.

644
38:26.880 --> 38:27.920
I don't believe

645
38:28.280 --> 38:29.800
they could ever track me down here.

646
38:31.800 --> 38:33.639
You never know.

647
38:33.719 --> 38:37.440
We'll have to face this hurdle sooner or later.

648
38:50.320 --> 38:53.760
Instead of just waiting to be slaughtered,

649
38:55.440 --> 38:57.000
we should make the first move.

650
39:05.480 --> 39:06.000
Come in.

651
39:12.639 --> 39:13.480
Brother Min, Sister Min.

652
39:14.199 --> 39:15.199
Mr. Chang just called.

653
39:15.239 --> 39:16.719
He said he wants to introduce a seller to us.

654
39:18.480 --> 39:19.159
Chang Zai?

655
39:19.760 --> 39:21.159
Introduce a seller to me?

656
39:21.400 --> 39:22.519
Did you hear that right?

657
39:23.320 --> 39:24.679
He still gets his supply from me.

658
39:24.679 --> 39:25.280
Mr. Chang said

659
39:25.280 --> 39:27.000
he's introducing someone named Mr. Ma,

660
39:27.000 --> 39:29.440
and that he gets goods straight from Jiechan State.

661
39:29.800 --> 39:31.440
He said we can get as much as we want.

662
39:34.440 --> 39:35.719
Mr. Ma?

663
39:38.920 --> 39:39.920
Jiechan State...

664
39:42.519 --> 39:43.760
Did you ask

665
39:44.320 --> 39:45.760
what this Mr. Ma's full name is?

666
39:46.079 --> 39:47.679
I asked. They said it's Ma Jingrong.

667
39:48.000 --> 39:49.320
Ma Jingrong.

668
39:56.119 --> 39:57.960
This Mr. Cheng...

669
39:58.400 --> 40:00.079
When is he going to show up?

670
40:01.199 --> 40:03.079
Mr. Ma, don't worry.

671
40:03.880 --> 40:05.119
The way this guy operates,

672
40:05.320 --> 40:06.920
he's always extremely cautious.

673
40:07.400 --> 40:08.599
You're lucky to have me.

674
40:09.400 --> 40:10.480
With anyone else,

675
40:10.639 --> 40:12.000
you wouldn't even catch a glimpse of him.

676
40:14.639 --> 40:15.400
He's calling.

677
40:18.199 --> 40:18.840
Boss Cheng.

678
40:19.480 --> 40:20.239
Look out the window.

679
40:23.119 --> 40:23.880
Follow me.

680
40:24.840 --> 40:26.239
All right, see you in a bit.

681
40:26.599 --> 40:27.400
Come on, follow him.

682
41:11.320 --> 41:12.039
Boss Cheng.

683
41:14.119 --> 41:15.039
And this is

684
41:15.360 --> 41:16.800
the one I told you about,

685
41:16.800 --> 41:18.440
Mr. Ma Jingrong.

686
41:20.119 --> 41:20.880
Hello, Mr. Cheng.

687
41:21.360 --> 41:22.119
Hello, Mr. Ma.

688
41:22.679 --> 41:23.159
Xiao Zhuang.

689
41:24.519 --> 41:25.239
Hello, Mr. Cheng.

690
41:25.960 --> 41:27.880
So you're Ma Jingrong.

691
41:30.000 --> 41:32.280
Could I speak with Brother Ma in private?

692
41:32.480 --> 41:33.639
Sure, I'll leave you two to talk.

693
41:35.239 --> 41:36.000
After you, Mr. Ma.

694
41:48.840 --> 41:49.639
So you mean...

695
41:51.360 --> 41:53.519
Piyazi has long wanted to replace me.

696
41:54.960 --> 41:57.119
He sent Four-Legged Snake to Nanhai City

697
41:57.599 --> 41:59.840
just to wipe out your crew.

698
42:03.039 --> 42:05.159
I never believed in

699
42:05.159 --> 42:07.719
their so-called underworld loyalty.

700
42:08.079 --> 42:09.599
So the moment I learned

701
42:09.599 --> 42:12.119
the shipment to Nanhai went wrong,

702
42:12.280 --> 42:13.880
I went into hiding immediately.

703
42:16.320 --> 42:17.880
If I end up in the cops' hands,

704
42:18.400 --> 42:20.480
at worst, I could cooperate for a suspended death sentence.

705
42:21.480 --> 42:23.639
But if Piyazi gets his hands on me,

706
42:23.880 --> 42:25.519
it's certain death.

707
42:28.400 --> 42:31.519
The two of us are in the same boat now.

708
42:32.840 --> 42:34.440
Piyazi is far away in Jiechan State,

709
42:34.440 --> 42:35.599
so we don't have to worry about him.

710
42:35.960 --> 42:38.239
But Xiang Nan will be like a mad dog,

711
42:39.280 --> 42:41.039
refusing to let us go.

712
42:42.679 --> 42:45.599
Now you can get the goods straight from Jiechan State,

713
42:46.039 --> 42:46.760
while I

714
42:46.960 --> 42:50.239
have the most crucial clients on the mainland.

715
42:50.599 --> 42:51.679
If we partner up,

716
42:52.199 --> 42:54.719
making fast, big money won't be an issue.

717
42:55.039 --> 42:56.880
Only, if Xiang Nan finds out

718
42:56.960 --> 42:58.320
that we took over his market,

719
42:58.480 --> 43:00.400
he definitely won't let us off.

720
43:03.480 --> 43:04.320
As for Xiang Nan,

721
43:06.119 --> 43:07.079
what's your plan?

722
43:09.079 --> 43:11.920
I'd like to ask Boss Ma for a favor.

723
43:25.920 --> 43:26.800
Call Yang Xing.

724
43:26.880 --> 43:27.239
Yes, sir.

725
43:49.119 --> 43:49.920
Did everything go smoothly?

726
43:51.360 --> 43:52.760
This Cheng Weimin...

727
43:54.079 --> 43:56.000
used to be Xiang Nan's downline.

728
43:56.480 --> 43:57.079
Now,

729
43:57.079 --> 43:58.440
he wants to take his clients

730
43:58.440 --> 43:59.880
and work with us.

731
44:00.480 --> 44:01.360
But if he does that,

732
44:02.599 --> 44:04.239
Xiang Nan definitely won't let him off.

733
44:06.079 --> 44:06.840
So,

734
44:08.079 --> 44:11.000
he wants to use us to get rid of Xiang Nan.
